# Consolidation

Read [`wiki/decisions/ADR-007-repository-layout.md`](../../wiki/decisions/ADR-007-repository-layout.md).

- `consolidation/` is being dissolved into the root. Its old "live tree is read-only" rule is retired.
- Until each part moves, edit it in place under `consolidation/`.
- Do not add new top-level concepts here; use the target root in ADR-007.
- Mirrors are gitignored, so git does not protect them. `sync_desktop_data.py` is the only sync, and `~/sts` gets none.
